<title>ROMANIA: BUCHAREST BOURSE CLOSES AHEAD OF CHRISTMAS.</title>
<headline>BUCHAREST BOURSE CLOSES AHEAD OF CHRISTMAS.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bucharest stock exchange said on Thursday it was closing down for the winter holidays after consultations with brokers.</p>
<p>A bourse statement said trading would resume on January 7.</p>
<p>At this year's last trading session on Thursday turnover rose some 14 million lei from the previous session, but remained low at 40 million in thin demand.</p>
<p>-- Luli Popescu, Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
